(6528448, 970849, 117037, '<td valign="top">2 slices of half flare give another beautiful looks on this image.</td>', '2 slices of half flare give another beautiful looks on this image.', '2011-09-05 03:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6528454, 970841, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely work and classic lens flare (in this case not the star burst but the aperture blade flare) however the star burst lines at top radiating down are also visible. Anyone who DNMC''s or low votes star burst is making an uneducated mistake. <br/>What this also clearly shows is the rough serrated edges of the aperture blades...the more there are of them (this lens has 6 blades) and the smoother and higher quality they are the better your IQ will be, and less CA.</td>', 'Lovely work and classic lens flare (in this case not the star burst but the aperture blade flare) however the star burst lines at top radiating down are also visible. Anyone who DNMC''s or low votes star burst is making an uneducated mistake. What this also clearly shows is the rough serrated edges of the aperture blades...the more there are of them (this lens has 6 blades) and the smoother and higher quality they are the better your IQ will be, and less CA.', '2011-09-05 03:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6528455, 971207, 108580, '<td valign="top">Classic image using the flare creatively. Nice round flare too. Possibly a 9 bladed aperture, but looks like a HQ lens.</td>', 'Classic image using the flare creatively. Nice round flare too. Possibly a 9 bladed aperture, but looks like a HQ lens.', '2011-09-05 03:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6528456, 970956, 108580, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect and well thought out with the handful of filters. The on lens filter you used to get the colour separation on the dentists/surgeons lights will no doubt be revealed at roll over. I''d prefer you used white gloves than the blue furry ones.</td>', 'Very cool effect and well thought out with the handful of filters. The on lens filter you used to get the colour separation on the dentists/surgeons lights will no doubt be revealed at roll over. I''d prefer you used white gloves than the blue furry ones.', '2011-09-05 03:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6528458, 971316, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely typical 70''s style use of the field and flare. Subtle single yellow flare, effective and I especially like the backlit bushels.</td>', 'Lovely typical 70''s style use of the field and flare. Subtle single yellow flare, effective and I especially like the backlit bushels.', '2011-09-05 03:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
