(6528510, 970842, 108580, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Soft and lit up petal. No visible star burst nor typical 5-6-7-8-9 sided aperture flare but the lines of a star burst flare are perfectly used as leading lines. Well done. I wonder what the vehement "Star Burst" is not "Flare" crowd will do with this image...</td>', 'Beautiful. Soft and lit up petal. No visible star burst nor typical 5-6-7-8-9 sided aperture flare but the lines of a star burst flare are perfectly used as leading lines. Well done. I wonder what the vehement "Star Burst" is not "Flare" crowd will do with this image...', '2011-09-05 03:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
