(6528910, 970459, 108069, '<td valign="top">Pretty wild. Definitely an alien abduction about to happen, and I''m glad I''m at work and not sitting at home in the dark after a few beers. Cool shot.</td>', 'Pretty wild. Definitely an alien abduction about to happen, and I''m glad I''m at work and not sitting at home in the dark after a few beers. Cool shot.', '2011-09-05 11:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
