(6529009, 971334, 135937, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of creativity here and your photograph almost tells a story, however it doesn''t move me. Great idea though! *5*</td>', 'There is a lot of creativity here and your photograph almost tells a story, however it doesn''t move me. Great idea though! *5*', '2011-09-05 12:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6529010, 971065, 135937, '<td valign="top">This is a great concept, however I don''t think it is a particularly flattering image of your model. Maybe if she had tilted her head back some and looked further upward? *6*</td>', 'This is a great concept, however I don''t think it is a particularly flattering image of your model. Maybe if she had tilted her head back some and looked further upward? *6*', '2011-09-05 13:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6529013, 971349, 135937, '<td valign="top">Adorable! I just want to squish her cheeks. You absolutely capture the essence of innocence here. =) It almost looks like the light is too loud for her little ears. *8*</td>', 'Adorable! I just want to squish her cheeks. You absolutely capture the essence of innocence here. =) It almost looks like the light is too loud for her little ears. *8*', '2011-09-05 13:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6529020, 971346, 135937, '<td valign="top">This image feels flat to me. Perhaps if you had walked to your left and let the light reflect off of the fountain? You might have even been able to get a rainbow in the mist along with a flare.</td>', 'This image feels flat to me. Perhaps if you had walked to your left and let the light reflect off of the fountain? You might have even been able to get a rainbow in the mist along with a flare.', '2011-09-05 13:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6529021, 971223, 135937, '<td valign="top">Great perspective.</td>', 'Great perspective.', '2011-09-05 13:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6529044, 970964, 108580, '<td valign="top">Hardly any visible traditional aperture flare (perhaps one large half moon flare) let alone star burst flare so possibly shot wide open. I also saw this challenge as not only having to be dozens of flares but a creative minimalist way of using lens flare where it is creatively minimised. The sun itself has been flared by the optics but wide open you get no star burst flare if the optics and coatings are good. I''ll be keen to see what lens this is and in who''s capable hands.</td>', 'Hardly any visible traditional aperture flare (perhaps one large half moon flare) let alone star burst flare so possibly shot wide open. I also saw this challenge as not only having to be dozens of flares but a creative minimalist way of using lens flare where it is creatively minimised. The sun itself has been flared by the optics but wide open you get no star burst flare if the optics and coatings are good. I''ll be keen to see what lens this is and in who''s capable hands.', '2011-09-05 13:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6529046, 971045, 108580, '<td valign="top">Aperture <u>and</u> Star flare! Lovely scene.</td>', 'Aperture and Star flare! Lovely scene.', '2011-09-05 13:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
