(6534601, 971223, 117474, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you submitted this one! I really love it. Not voting, obviously, but I would give this 8 or more. Perhaps even a 10 with a coveted favourite. I''d have to think about it for  awhile. It''s so symmetric. Great great capture.<br/> <br/>One of the worst images in here, I think.</td>', 'I''m glad you submitted this one! I really love it. Not voting, obviously, but I would give this 8 or more. Perhaps even a 10 with a coveted favourite. I''d have to think about it for  awhile. It''s so symmetric. Great great capture. One of the worst images in here, I think.', '2011-09-09 06:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6534823, 971187, 118154, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.</td>', 'Very nice shot.', '2011-09-09 13:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
