(6535445, 971284, 103142, '<td valign="top">Bumping this up to a 10. Simply gorgeous, and the flare adds so much to this shot. Beautifully done. Wish I could give it an 11!</td>', 'Bumping this up to a 10. Simply gorgeous, and the flare adds so much to this shot. Beautifully done. Wish I could give it an 11!', '2011-09-10 08:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
