(6535452, 970814, 103142, '<td valign="top">Must be a jagar...? Wonderful shot. An 8 from me. I do wonder what it would have looked like with the guy walking down the other side of the street -- with the flares leading to him instead of splitting your focus.<br/> <br/>Still wonderful, though. :)</td>', 'Must be a jagar...? Wonderful shot. An 8 from me. I do wonder what it would have looked like with the guy walking down the other side of the street -- with the flares leading to him instead of splitting your focus. Still wonderful, though. :)', '2011-09-10 09:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
