(6535926, 971065, 107410, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and idea, however the flash coming from a different direction than the sun (in the arch and the side of the column) is very distracting to me. I do like that the subject is lit so as to not be silhouetted by the sunlight, but a more subtle touch of flash would''ve brought this shot to the next level.</td>', 'Nice concept and idea, however the flash coming from a different direction than the sun (in the arch and the side of the column) is very distracting to me. I do like that the subject is lit so as to not be silhouetted by the sunlight, but a more subtle touch of flash would''ve brought this shot to the next level.', '2011-09-10 21:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6535927, 970921, 107410, '<td valign="top">Halo around the top of the rock takes away from this shot.</td>', 'Halo around the top of the rock takes away from this shot.', '2011-09-10 21:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
