(6535929, 971076, 107410, '<td valign="top">I like this shot alot, but I feel like a square crop of just the top flower (framed the exact same way) would have been much stronger. 9</td>', 'I like this shot alot, but I feel like a square crop of just the top flower (framed the exact same way) would have been much stronger. 9', '2011-09-10 21:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
