(6537741, 971235, 104230, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> Wonderful image, Penny.  Didn''t even pick up that it was Bear. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>FWIW:  That was my intention for this pic. I kinda hoped it would be evaluated without any face recognition factors coming into play, so I''m pleased..  However, from the comments I know at least one person, Garry, recognized Robert.</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: Wonderful image, Penny.  Didn''t even pick up that it was Bear.   FWIW:  That was my intention for this pic. I kinda hoped it would be evaluated without any face recognition factors coming into play, so I''m pleased..  However, from the comments I know at least one person, Garry, recognized Robert.', '2011-09-12 17:15:54.000000', NULL, 0),
