(6537878, 971143, 60862, '<td valign="top">Oh, I know this spot!  I''ve spent a couple of hours a couple of times happily wandering around there taking pics.  Congrats on the great capture and the ribbon!</td>', 'Oh, I know this spot!  I''ve spent a couple of hours a couple of times happily wandering around there taking pics.  Congrats on the great capture and the ribbon!', '2011-09-12 21:36:34.000000', NULL, 0),
