(6537980, 970476, 50695, '<td valign="top">gorgeous, gorgeous light</td>', 'gorgeous, gorgeous light', '2011-09-12 23:05:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6537989, 971307, 30982, '<td valign="top">Why creepy, you asked?  I think in part the B&amp;W lends to it - I''m betting in color it''s a bit more cheerful and light.  It seems Frosty is melting, probably due to the warmth of the light flare, and Santa is taking some sort of perverse pleasure in that.  He has a bland, empty sort of expression (which is to be expected with a plastic figuring, I suppose) but it has sort of a "what''s it to ya?" feel.  I tell you, it''s a fascinating image!</td>', 'Why creepy, you asked?  I think in part the B&W lends to it - I''m betting in color it''s a bit more cheerful and light.  It seems Frosty is melting, probably due to the warmth of the light flare, and Santa is taking some sort of perverse pleasure in that.  He has a bland, empty sort of expression (which is to be expected with a plastic figuring, I suppose) but it has sort of a "what''s it to ya?" feel.  I tell you, it''s a fascinating image!', '2011-09-12 23:13:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(6537994, 971041, 50695, '<td valign="top">optical illusion, the left side looks crooked.<br/> <br/>you make magic with your weird ways, not to be trusted...</td>', 'optical illusion, the left side looks crooked. you make magic with your weird ways, not to be trusted...', '2011-09-12 23:19:49.000000', NULL, 0),
