(6539418, 971284, 82707, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Smee:</b></div><hr/><i> Exquisite light and shot.<br/>Just wondering if you used the Canon soft focus lens? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Your one comment in 6 and a half years on this site!  I am so very, very honoured......  <br/>...and when I find that Canon soft focus lens, I''ll be able to explain a lot!  LOL!<br/>I was trialing a friend''s Canon EF 70-200mm f/2.8L USM, at this shoot, and this was the third shot, that I took with it ..... It works beautifully with low light, but man, it is heavy.... for a free hand shooter!</td>', 'Originally posted by Smee: Exquisite light and shot.Just wondering if you used the Canon soft focus lens?  Your one comment in 6 and a half years on this site!  I am so very, very honoured......  ...and when I find that Canon soft focus lens, I''ll be able to explain a lot!  LOL!I was trialing a friend''s Canon EF 70-200mm f/2.8L USM, at this shoot, and this was the third shot, that I took with it ..... It works beautifully with low light, but man, it is heavy.... for a free hand shooter!', '2011-09-14 07:39:10.000000', NULL, 0),
